        "explanation": "Final doctor message confirms the caregiver's understanding and gives a clear home-going safety sequence with explicit medications, emergency thresholds, and follow-up, establishing a valid closure.",
        "quote": "现在照护者已经把正式出院药单和复查纸拿到手，并且护士已经逐条指着讲过，这是最可靠的证据。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
