        "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
        "explanation": "Doctor clarifies that the prior instruction not to take medication was not a permanent stop, but a safety pause during diagnostic uncertainty, resolving the caregiver's confusion.",
        "quote": "我们之前说“先都别吃”，并不是要让他长期停双抗，而是在服药历史完全不清楚、又没有医生当面的情况下，避免你凭猜测喂错或重复吃药"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00284",
        "explanation": "Doctor consistently tracks and reinforces the core safety message about not self-stopping antiplatelets and maintaining emergency vigilance across multiple turns.",
        "quote": "双抗不能停和漏服规则、达格列净是否继续且需看肾功能血钾、还有回家后什么情况直接急诊，这三件"
      }
    ],
