        "quote": "如果出现比现在更没劲、坐不住、喘、躺下难受、脚肿或者您感觉明显不一样，请立刻叫护士或急诊医生"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00238",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a practical, low-literacy checklist for the caregiver to ask the discharging nurse/doctor, adapting to the caregiver's fatigue and limited medical knowledge.",
        "quote": "我直接帮你把明天如果医生说能出院，你必须当场跟护士/医生核对清楚的三件事列出来，你到时候就按这个去问"
      }
    ]
  },
